<title>Introduction to Excel to CSPro</title>

<b>Excel to CSPro</b> is a CSPro tool that allows you to convert data from Excel spreadsheets to CSPro data sources. Many CSPro users want to incorporate data that is stored in Excel format in their programs, generally as lookup reference files, and this tool facilicates the easy conversion of this data.

If you have a CSPro dictionary that describes your data, you can use the tool to <link mapping_dictionary_to_excel.csdoc>convert from Excel data to CSPro data</link>. If you do not have a preexisting CSPro dictionary, you can use the tool to <link creating_a_dictionary_from_an_excel_file.csdoc>analyze an Excel worksheet</link> and create a CSPro dictionary that describes your data.

